# Data (proprietary, third-party licensed, or too large for GitHub — see
# README.md "Data" section for download links). Folder structure and
# PROVENANCE.md docs are tracked so contributors know where to place
# downloaded files; actual data content is ignored.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/PROVENANCE.md
!data/**/.gitkeep
output/
OSMtrees.gpkg

# Manuscript (not included in repo)
manuscript/

# Internal project documentation
CODE_REVIEW.md
PROJECT_STATUS.md
contrast/
other_analysis/

